{
 "about": "Spellings of one value in a literal of a condition: a number, a quoted string, a list of quoted strings and a list of numbers, each in the spellings a condition may hold, compared with a resource attribute. Every probe is one side of an opposite pair: the same value spelled plainly, or the same literal against the value another reading would make of it (trimmed, split, a JSON number). A pair that answers apart is a finding whatever each answer is.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R44_SPELL_LITERALS_",
 "pins": {},
 "pips": {},
